 "final_text_tail": "The bug is in the `axis == 1` branch of `NDFrame._pad_or_backfill` (`pandas/core/generic.py:7204`). It transposes, fills, and transposes back, but never passes `inplace` through and never writes the result into `self`, so the caller gets a copy. The `ffill` and `bfill` wrappers only forward their arguments, so they don't need changes.\n\n{\"files\": [\"pandas/core/generic.py\", \"pandas/core/internals/blocks.py\", \"pandas/core/missing.py\"], \"functions\": [\"NDFrame._pad_or_backfill\", \"NDFrame.ffill\", \"NDFrame.bfill\", \"EABackedBlock.pad_or_backfill\", \"Block.pad_or_backfill\"]}",
